      "id": "claim_7b6f74ddeb864b87b45963d4c8156794",
      "statement": "`createRhAuth({ apiBaseUrl, onError })` initializes the kit's auth store and returns an installable Vue plugin carrying authGuard and publicGuard, and the store checks the session the moment it is created, so any fragment token must be stored before createRhAuth runs.",
