    {
      "id": "claim_b90557c862554e6ca5523497e9794b58",
      "statement": "The `onError` option receives every ApiError from the kit's requests, which is the only client-side place the consents gate can observe a 451 because the store absorbs session-restoration failures with an internal catch.",
