    {
      "id": "claim_6cf188a30ab94bd784e4a125efdbe4c1",
      "statement": "`useAuth()` exposes reactive `user`, `teams` and `isAuthenticated` for templates and script, with `teams` entries carrying `id.$oid`, `role` and an `active` flag used for team switching in the UI.",
