      "id": "claim_ca34407132f844e4ad8a43e3ea61c597",
      "statement": "`auth.checkSession()` both restores the session on app start (absorbing failure) and is called explicitly after `acceptConsents()` to reload user and teams, and screens call it on mount to populate profile fields.",
