        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_15bbcc82d1184b6ca27bc911b07ae347",
      "statement": "Before createRhAuth can be used, the app validates `apiUrl` with the kit's `isValidApiBaseUrl` and mounts only the ConfigPage when it is invalid, because a store created without a service would run session checks against nowhere.",
